  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "怎麼會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "我們明明只消滅了一個整合運動小隊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "還順勢按倒了一個大塊頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "這個才是重頭戲好嗎，為了對付他，我可是累壞了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "那麼多感染者，怎麼可能消失的無影無蹤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "剛才那個大傢伙，只是打個掩護而已？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合運動在這麼短的時間裡撤出了這個區域？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不，陳長官理應截斷了他們的後路——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我看不到訊息點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "這裡......不對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "雜草，廢墟，沙丘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "全是值得埋伏的地點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "但我，什麼都看不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "腳印，服飾刮擦植物的聲音，爆炸物特有的氣息......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "我沒法判斷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "企鵝快遞的傢伙，打起精神來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "一切都不對勁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "收聲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "是什麼聲音......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "————嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "是從......地下！？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "阿米婭！從地下傳來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "博士！！快趴下！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "這群人......真是不擇手段！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "————！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "怎麼......你居然......能擋住？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "這面“般若”，可不是你能打得穿的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "那可......未必......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "溫度急劇升高！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "他想引爆手中的魔杖嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "博士！快跑！那個距離，你會————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "結束了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不......不要———"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不能—————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不可以傷害博士———————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "咳，咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......很厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你......這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你好強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......咳......好疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "明明有這種力量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......你......就甘......心......看著同胞們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我不能，原諒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "原諒你們這種......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "不...........不要............."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
